/t_thumb/sctu2w.jpg"}, {"id": 251165, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/vjrwkmz57ape0mwsc5ha.jpg"}, {"id": 251167, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/mavur0krljksxvxtlvmo.jpg"}], "slug": "doom-eternal", "storyline": "Earth has been overrun by demons, wiping out 60% of the planet's population. The Doom Slayer returns with a satellite fortress to end the invasion by hunting down three Hell Priests who serve the Khan Maykr, an angelic being willing to sacrifice humanity for her own race's survival. As the Slayer eliminates the priests one by one, he uncovers a deeper conflict between Heaven, Hell, and an ancient pact that has fed on human souls for eons.", "summary": "Doom Eternal is a first-person shooter developed by id Software and the sequel to Doom (2016). Players control the Doom Slayer as he fights to end a demonic invasion of Earth. Combat is built around aggressive resource management, where health, armor, and ammo are gained by executing, igniting, or chainsawing enemies. The game introduces platforming segments, destructible enemy weak points, an expanded weapon arsenal, and a multiplayer mode called Battlemode, where one player-controlled Slayer fights two player-controlled demons.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 39, "name": "Warfare"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/doom-eternal", "videos": [{"id": 27893, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "BbIBsrnkOf0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BbIBsrnkOf0", "title": "DOOM Eternal \u2013 BATTLEMODE Multiplayer Teaser", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/BbIBsrnkOf0/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 27892, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "2HOClc6Svg4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2HOClc6Svg4", "title": "DOOM Eternal \u2013 Official E3 Story Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/2HOClc6Svg4/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 33387, "name": "Trailer", "video_